'''Kawalidipa''' is a country in the south of [[Lurandia]]. It covers an area of approximately 1,508,519 km² and borders [[Louyang]], [[Mishko]], [[Nawat]], [[Nuuchi]], [[Tuvayo]], the [[United Midlands]] and [[Winnipi]].

